# ministral-3:3b with a 32k-token context window, large enough for opencode,
# and a temperature of 0, so that its answers are reproducible.
# Ollama ignores the context size sent through its OpenAI-compatible API, which opencode uses:
# it has to be part of the model. Build it with
#   ollama create ministral-3:3b-32k -f .opencode/Modelfile
FROM ministral-3:3b
PARAMETER num_ctx 32768
PARAMETER temperature 0
